AI Salesperson — AI Sales Employee

Imagine you could hire a salesperson that works 24 hours a day, never gets tired, and can handle hundreds of potential customers at the same time.

That's the idea behind AI Salesperson.

AI Salesperson is an AI-powered sales platform that allows any business to create and deploy its own AI sales agent without needing technical knowledge.

The customer simply creates an account, enters information about their business, products, services, target customers, countries, and sales goals.

For example, imagine a software development company.

They tell AI Salesperson:

«"We build mobile applications and websites for restaurants in Lebanon and the UAE."»

AI Salesperson then creates a customized sales strategy.

It identifies the company's ideal customers, researches potential businesses using permitted data sources and integrations, analyzes their public information, identifies potential business needs, and generates personalized outreach.

Instead of sending the same generic message to every company, AI Salesperson can create a different message for each qualified prospect.

For example:

«"Hi Ahmed, I noticed that your restaurant recently opened a second location. We help restaurants build branded ordering applications that allow customers to order directly from their phones."»

The important part is that AI Salesperson doesn't stop after sending the first message.

It can manage the entire sales process.

It can understand replies, answer common questions, identify buying intent, qualify leads, handle objections, follow up, and move qualified prospects into the CRM.

For example, if a potential customer asks:

«"How much does it cost?"»

AI Salesperson can respond appropriately and ask qualification questions.

If the customer says:

«"We already have a POS system."»

AI Salesperson can recognize that as an objection and continue the conversation instead of simply repeating the sales pitch.

Once the prospect becomes interested, AI Salesperson can help schedule a meeting with the sales team.

The entire process becomes:

Find → Research → Personalize → Engage → Qualify → Follow Up → Book Meeting → Convert

And this isn't limited to software companies.

A wholesaler could use AI Salesperson to find supermarkets.

A real-estate company could use it to identify potential buyers or businesses.

A marketing agency could use it to find companies that need marketing services.

A logistics company could use it to identify businesses that need delivery services.

The customer simply tells AI Salesperson what they sell and who they want to sell to.

The AI builds the sales strategy around that information.

