The Technology

The platform can be built as a multi-tenant SaaS architecture.

The frontend can use Next.js.

The backend can use Go.

PostgreSQL can handle the core business data.

Redis can handle queues and real-time workloads.

Background workers can perform research, lead processing, campaign execution, and other asynchronous tasks.

An AI gateway can allow the platform to use different AI models without locking the entire system to a single provider.

Most importantly, integrations should be built using a modular adapter architecture.

For example:

Prospecting Sources

→ Business directories

→ Customer-provided lists

→ Public websites

→ Approved APIs

→ CRM data

Communication Channels

→ Email

→ WhatsApp

→ Approved social integrations

→ Human approval workflows

This is important because every platform has different APIs, permissions, automation policies, and rate limits.

AI Salesperson should automate only what the relevant platform permits.

